### Scénario Owner -> Property -> Room -> Reservation
### Lancer l'appli : ./mvnw spring-boot:run
### Pour rejouer : changer les deux labels et les bookingReference (tous uniques).
### Coller les access tokens Keycloak (realm ddclean) : un utilisateur CUSTOMER et un ADMIN (simulate).
### Le customer du owner est lu dans le token, pas dans le JSON.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@customerToken = <access token CUSTOMER>
@adminToken = <access token ADMIN>
@loftLabel = Loft am Pegnitztal Nürnberg
@studioLabel = Studio Altstadt Nürnberg

### 1. Créer un propriétaire avec 2 logements et leurs chambres
POST {{host}}/api/owners
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anna Schmidt",
  "email": "anna@example.com",
  "phone": "+49 911 000000",
  "properties": [
    { "name": "Loft Pegnitz", "emailLabel": "{{loftLabel}}", "city": "Nürnberg", "postalCode": "90402",
      "rooms": [ { "number": "101", "price": 45.00 }, { "number": "2B", "price": 55.50 } ] },
    { "name": "Studio Altstadt", "emailLabel": "{{studioLabel}}", "city": "Nürnberg",
      "rooms": [ { "number": "Mansarde", "price": 60.00 } ] }
  ]
}

> {%
  client.global.set("ownerId", response.body.id);
  client.global.set("propertyId", response.body.properties[0].id);
%}

### 1b. Ajouter une chambre à un logement existant
POST {{host}}/api/properties/{{propertyId}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "number": "102", "price": 48.00 }

### 1c. Chambres du logement
GET {{host}}/api/properties/{{propertyId}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 2. 3 réservations sur le premier logement, en une seule liste
POST {{host}}/api/reservations/simulate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "emailLabel": "{{loftLabel}}", "roomNumber": "101", "bookingReference": "BK-9001-1",
    "arrivalDate": "2026-11-02", "arrivalDay": "Montag", "departureDate": "2026-11-05", "channel": "Booking.com", "status": "CONFIRMED" },
  { "emailLabel": "{{loftLabel}}", "roomNumber": "2B", "bookingReference": "BK-9001-2",
    "arrivalDate": "2026-11-06", "arrivalDay": "Freitag", "departureDate": "2026-11-09", "channel": "Airbnb", "status": "CONFIRMED" },
  { "emailLabel": "{{loftLabel}}", "roomNumber": "101", "bookingReference": "BK-9001-3",
    "arrivalDate": "2026-11-12", "arrivalDay": "Donnerstag", "departureDate": "2026-11-14", "channel": "Booking.com", "status": "CONFIRMED" }
]

> {% client.global.set("reservationId", response.body[0].id); %}

### 2b. Sans roomNumber -> roomNumber = "unique" (logement à une seule chambre : prix de cette chambre)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations/simulate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "emailLabel": "{{studioLabel}}", "bookingReference": "BK-9001-4",
    "arrivalDate": "2026-11-16", "arrivalDay": "Montag", "departureDate": "2026-11-18", "channel": "Airbnb", "status": "CONFIRMED" }
]

### 3. Renvoyer la réservation 1 modifiée -> mise à jour, pas de doublon
POST {{host}}/api/reservations/simulate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "emailLabel": "{{loftLabel}}", "roomNumber": "101", "bookingReference": "BK-9001-1",
    "arrivalDate": "2026-11-02", "arrivalDay": "Montag", "departureDate": "2026-11-06", "channel": "Booking.com", "status": "MODIFIED" }
]

### 4a. emailLabel inconnu -> 404 (toute la liste est annulée)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations/simulate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "emailLabel": "Logement inconnu", "roomNumber": "101", "bookingReference": "BK-9001-X",
    "arrivalDate": "2026-11-02", "arrivalDay": "Montag", "departureDate": "2026-11-05", "channel": "Booking.com", "status": "CONFIRMED" }
]

### 4b. Chambre inconnue -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/reservations/simulate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "emailLabel": "{{loftLabel}}", "roomNumber": "999", "bookingReference": "BK-9001-Y",
    "arrivalDate": "2026-11-02", "arrivalDay": "Montag", "departureDate": "2026-11-05", "channel": "Booking.com", "status": "CONFIRMED" }
]

### 5. Lister les réservations du premier logement -> 3
GET {{host}}/api/properties/{{propertyId}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 5b. Filtrer par période
GET {{host}}/api/properties/{{propertyId}}/reservations?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-07
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Toutes les réservations
GET {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Réservations du customer connecté (customer lu dans le jeton)
GET {{host}}/api/reservations/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Détails
GET {{host}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/properties/{{propertyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/owners/{{ownerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/owners/{{ownerId}}/properties
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/owners
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
